  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## The recordings\n\n- **BS2018-11-15** (recommended): source not stated; 22 songs; 137 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n- **billystrings2018-11-15.at853.24.flac**: source not stated; 23 songs; 138 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Mics were clamped to the balcony PAS, about 1.5 feet right of center; the venue and crew were taper friendly [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **BS2018-11-15**: taped by Brain; transferred by Brain; source: AKG C568EB's & MBHO 603a's (hyper cardiod capsules)> Sound Devices MixPre-6 [1]\n- **billystrings2018-11-15.at853.24.flac**: taped by DavidPuddy; transferred by DavidPuddy; source: AT853c > CA9100 > M10 [2]. Also: Recorded with AT-853 cardioid mics into a Church Audio 9100 preamp and Sony M10 at 24-bit/48kHz; Transfer chain: MicroSD, edited in Audacity, converted to FLAC with Trader's Little Helper, tagged in Foobar2000, then LMA [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by thecurtainwithblog.blogspot.com: [Billy Strings - 2018-11-15 Terminal West, Atlanta, GA](https://thecurtainwithblog.blogspot.com/2019/11/billy-strings-2018-11-15-terminal-west.html) [5]",
